ETBALL_MATCH","sourceSystemId":"61"},{"text":"Panathinaikos AKTOR Athens v Maccabi Rapyd Tel Aviv (2025-10-28T19:15:00.000Z)","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_MATCH","sourceSystemId":"65"},{"text":"Zalgiris Kaunas v Virtus Bologna (2025-10-28T18:00:00.000Z)","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_MATCH","sourceSystemId":"68"},{"text":"Crvena Zvezda Meridianbet Belgrade v LDLC ASVEL Villeurbanne (2025-10-28T18:00:00.000Z)","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_MATCH","sourceSystemId":"62"},{"sourceSystem":"MEDIA","sourceSystemId":"0d3f0ad0-6acb-4a91-98e7-20d985b2c987"}],"readTimeMinutes":1,"auth":{"loginRequired":null,"roles":[],"entitlements":[]},"content":[{"id":"5c41ab95-9516-4ddb-a2b2-8c01a3156e50","contentType":"TEXT","text":"It's time for Episode 5! There is little time to set your EuroLeague Fantasy Challenge lineups for Round 6 this week with eight games on Tuesday night! So tune in now to hear from [Frankie Sachs](https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FMrEuroleague\u0026data=05%7C02%7Cgeoff.gillingham%40euroleague.net%7C8f23c17ba6e24a938a4c08ddff3a0ce8%7C2b3d64f0329542979f1528435f0a62ce%7C1%7C0%7C638947346960894891%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C\u0026sdata=qhPt96t3ngeIaZ%2FSU%2FA67vi5euxZ5OVn9QfMhhj343M%3D\u0026reserved=0) of [EuroLeague.net](http://EuroLeague.net), Sport 24's [Vasiliki Karamouza](https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fkaramouza_vas\u0026data=05%7C02%7Cgeoff.gillingham%40euroleague.net%7C8f23c17ba6e24a938a4c08ddff3a0ce8%7C2b3d64f0329542979f1528435f0a62ce%7C1%7C0%7C638947346960937569%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C\u0026sdata=RuVg%2FRj%2BbH%2FiJbU%2BYkpXVo6vX%2B39lXvvomI9gNtMJLs%3D\u0026reserved=0) and special guard and expert Arela Weisberg for a special Eastern Mediterranean Episode.\n\nThe three of them take you through the latest injury news, from the questions surrounding Partizan Mozzart Bet Belgrade and Crvena Zvezda Meridianbet Belgrade, to how to handle Nigel Williams-Goss absence for Zalgiris Kaunas and what to make of Kendrick Nunn and Juancho Hernangomez sitting out Panathinaikos AKTOR Athens’s Greek league win on Sunday.  \n\nThey also discuss strategy tips for both ends of the two-round week. Additional topics covered were how old Nando De Colo really is, the first-half scoring ability of Lonnie Walker, whether Donatas Motiejunas is the best-priced center in fantasy and if Vasiliki can be trusted to choose head coaches. As a bonus topic, Frankie is asked if Nadir Hifi iffy!\n\nAs always, Frankie, Vasiliki and Arale, reveal their teams for Round 7 and react to questions sent in by Fantasy Podcast viewers. Enjoy this episode and best of luck to our fantasy friends in this week's games.","isHtml":false,"sponsor":null},{"id":"3f67d60f-8bb3-4add-9cb3-c66780b3af5a","contentType":"RELATED_CONTENT","title":"More EuroLeague Fantasy Challenge News","relatedParameters":{"articleId":"60f3c6d7-a8bd-4fd5-9c4f-64b7621582f8","relatedCategories":["c0606798-6082-4d94-9a1a-926271f8d4ae"],"specificContent":[],"tags":[]}}],"categories":[{"text":"Euroleague News","id":"dd63261c-b945-4737-b3fb-ff56300747d0"},{"text":"Fantasy Challenge","id":"c0606798-6082-4d94-9a1a-926271f8d4ae"},{"text":"Podcasts","id":"fd566130-6941-446c-bc90-fec49a65b9cc"},{"text":"Euroleague Video","id":"0bf0ba1d-d53d-4f81-b536-691f67c86280"},{"text":"Podcasts","id":"23aa56eb-5b34-43bd-8b2b-f41e8c22685b"},{"text":"Seasons","id":"2337e0ea-a3c8-488e-b338-5fdc76cb933b"},{"text":"2025-26","id":"d9570b85-5aff-4d8e-8515-fa05b83552a8"}],"language":"en","localisedVersions":[],"articleMetadata":{"title":"Fantasy Challenge Podcast: Making picks with Arale","description":"It's time for Episode 5! There is little time to set your EuroLeague Fantasy Challenge lineups for Round 6 this week with eight games on Tuesday night! So tune in now to hear from Frankie Sachs of EuroLeague.net, Sport 24's Vasiliki Karamouza and special guard and expert Arela Weisberg for a special Eastern Mediterranean Episode.","ogTitle":null,"ogDescription":null,"ogType":null,"ogImageUrl":null,"twitterCard":null,"twitterSite":null,"twitterCreator":null}},{"pageType":"Article","generatedUrl":"/en/euroleague/news/euroleague-round-6-top-10-plays-el2526/","id":"f0f6701b-ec9a-4996-94cb-b8c96f32140f","publishDate":"2025-10-25T11:56:05.037Z","lastModified":"2025-10-27T09:01:40.368Z","displayCategory":{"id":"5266fa1f-d4eb-4c8c-8a9b-528cbdb487f2","text":"Top 10s"},"author":{"name":null,"title":null,"imageUrl":null,"socialHandles":[]},"slug":"euroleague-round-6-top-10-plays-el2526","heroMedia":{"content":{"contentType":"VIDEO","sourceSystem":"YOUTUBE","sourceSystemId":"6V3bbxJCbPA","videoThumbnail":"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6V3bbxJCbPA/maxresdefault.jpg","title":"EuroLeague Round 6: Top 10 plays","description":""},"title":"EuroLeague Round 6: Top 10 plays","summary":"Round 6 of the 2025–26 EuroLeague didn't disappoint. Check out the Top 10 plays from Wednesday, Thursday and Friday, and find out which moment stole the spotlight."},"linkedIds":[{"text":"Euroleague","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_COMPETITION","sourceSystemId":"E"},{"sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_COMPETITION","sourceSystemId":"E2025"},{"text":"Maccabi Rapyd Tel Aviv","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_TEAM","sourceSystemId":"TEL"},{"text":"Maccabi Rapyd Tel Aviv v Real Madrid (2025-10-22T18:05:00.000Z)","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_MATCH","sourceSystemId":"51"},{"text":"BLATT, TAMIR","sourceSystem":"FS_BASKETBALL_PLAYER","sourceSystemId":"011193"}],"readTimeMinutes":null,"auth":{"loginRequired":null,"roles":[],"entitlements":[]},"content":[],"categories":[{"text":"Euroleague Video","id":"0bf0ba1d-d53d-4f81-b536-691f67c86280"},{"text":"Top 10s","id":"5266fa1f-d4eb-4c8c-8a9b-528cbdb487f2"},{"text":"Seasons","id":"2337e0ea-a3c8-488e-b338-5fdc76cb933b"},